<Slide style={{width: '1280px', height: '720px', background: '#FFFFFF', padding: '0px', fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei'}}><Box style={{position: 'absolute', top: 0, left: 0, width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#FFFFFF'}}></Box><Box style={{position: 'absolute', top: 100, left: 60, width: 400, gap: 6}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#3D7BD9', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'left' }}>CHAPTER</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 156, color: '#D6E4F7', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'left' }}>01</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#8B97A8', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.26, textAlign: 'left' }}>问题 · 方法 · 机制</Text></Box><Box style={{position: 'absolute', top: 132, left: 480, width: 740, gap: 17}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 37, color: '#0E3F8C', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'left' }}>任务分配：问题与决策</Text><Box style={{width: 740, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 11, alignItems: 'center'}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#1E4FA8', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'left' }}>01</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 22, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.3, textAlign: 'left' }}>任务持续到达、机队能力时变、机巢分散、三维地形代价同时存在</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 740, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 11, alignItems: 'center'}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#1E4FA8', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'left' }}>02</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 22, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.3, textAlign: 'left' }}>单周期四类决策 y / x / π / z 联合确定，取舍必须写进模型</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 740, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 11, alignItems: 'center'}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#1E4FA8', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'left' }}>03</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 22, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.3, textAlign: 'left' }}>组合规模随 N! 与 B 的 U 次方增长，全要素精确求解不可达</Text></Box><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#8B97A8', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.3, textAlign: 'left' }}>导览：P4 · 五个结构性特征　　P5 · 四类决策与目标口径</Text></Box><Box style={{position: 'absolute', top: 588, left: 480, width: 740, background: '#F0F5FC', paddingLeft: 15, justifyContent: 'center'}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#0E3F8C', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.26, textAlign: 'left' }}>静态一次性规划失效，是因为「任务集固定 / 全部执行 / 平面距离」三个前提都不成立。</Text></Box></Slide>